              "{\"articleSection\":\"Business\",\"keywords\":[\"ASIA\",\"CEN\",\"CN\",\"ECI\",\"ECON\",\"GDP\",\"IPR\",\"JOB\",\"NEWS1\",\"PLCY\",\"POL\",\"TOPNWS\",\"TRD\",\"TRF\"],\"headline\":\"China's growth could slip below 6%, analysts warn, as trade war takes toll\",\"dateCreated\":\"2019-09-19T09:58:46.000Z\",\"datePublished\":\"2019-09-19T09:58:46.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2019-09-19T08:55:41.000Z\",\"author\":[{\"name\":\"Kevin Yao\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.reuters.com/authors/kevin-yao/\"},{\"name\":\"Stella Qiu\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.reuters.com/authors/stella-qiu/\"}],\"isAccessibleForFree\":false,\"hasPart\":{\"isAccessibleForFree\":false},\"publisher\":{\"name\":\"Reuters\"},\"isPartOf\":{\"name\":\"Reuters\",\"productID\":\"CAowt6AM:showcase\"}}"
            ]
